  //                                     50 px orb. See NAV_EMISSIVE_MAX.
  //                                     Author these at EXTREMITIES ONLY, six
  //                                     to ten per capital — a continuous
  //                                     perimeter run reads as a runway, and
  //                                     the shader cannot fix count or rhythm.
